U^2-Net  —  salient object detection weights (u2net.onnx)
    Source:   https://github.com/xuebinqin/U-2-Net
    Licence:  Apache License 2.0
    Weights are redistributed inside the a4norm:full image only. The light
    image contains no model and no inference runtime.

    Cited as: Qin et al., "U^2-Net: Going Deeper with Nested U-Structure for
    Salient Object Detection", Pattern Recognition, 2020.

    Only the `u2net` weights are used. rembg's other checkpoints are NOT
    shipped and must not be substituted: isnet-general-use and isnet-anime
    inherit DIS5K's non-commercial terms, bria-rmbg is non-commercial, and
    u2net_portrait was trained on APDrawing, also non-commercial. a4norm-seg
    therefore pins the model by name and has no fallback.

